<article class="env-lemma" id="04HY">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/04HY">Lemma <span data-tag="04HY">59.33.3</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $s \in S$. Then we have </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \mathcal{O}_{S, s}^ h = \mathop{\mathrm{colim}}\nolimits _{(U, u)} \mathcal{O}(U)  \]
</div>
  <p> where the colimit is over the filtered category of étale neighbourhoods $(U, u)$ of $(S, s)$ such that $\kappa (s) = \kappa (u)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This lemma is a copy of More on Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/05KS" data-tag="05KS">37.35.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>